WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Quantquer. Research-driven AI and deep-tech engineering.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Recorded MI-GAN model output with a supplied mask.
Desktop CPU and controlled still image.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Anonymized delivery: workcell layouts, CAD,
and equipment bill of materials.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Four-stage photonic mesh software simulation.
The first view is the ideal lossless reference.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Injecting phase drift and attenuation changes the simulated outputs.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Recorded run on one GPU. The CPU-only task
starts alongside the first CUDA task.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The second CUDA task waits for the GPU slot to become available.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:43.000
An offline check with paper-evidence accepts the number supported by its quote
and rejects a number from another context.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Discuss your deployment target and acceptance criteria with Quantquer.
